          "pali": "Sacajja mayaṃ kāyena sucaritaṃ careyyāma, vācāya … manasā sucaritaṃ careyyāma, evaṃ mayaṃ kāyassa bhedā paraṃ maraṇā sugatiṃ saggaṃ lokaṃ upapajjeyyāma."
        },
        {
          "id": "sn29.6:2.5",
          "pali": "Handa mayaṃ etarahi kāyena sucaritaṃ carāma, vācāya … manasā sucaritaṃ carāmā’ti."
        },
        {
